==Strategy==
This stage contains some high DPS enemies, so it's recommended to bring at least 3 meatshields. Some longer range units like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] are good to bring against the stack of enemies. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut]] or [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] are also good options thanks to them outranging all the enemies on this stage and having strong damage.

